{c: Verse 1}
[G] O Ri Chiraiya Nanhi si chidiya,        [C] Angana mein [D] phir aja [G] re
[G] O Ri Chiraiya Nanhi si chidiya,        [C] Angana mein [D] phir aja [G] re
Andhiyaa [Em] ra [D] hai [G] ghanaa,        Aur [Em7] lahoo se [D] sanaa
[G] Kirno ke tinke ambar se chunke,        [C] Angana mein [D] phir aja [G] re
Humne [Em] tujhpe [G] hazaaro,        [D] Sitam hain [G] kiye
Humne [Em] tujhpe [G] jahan bhar ke,        [D] Zulmm [G] kiye
Humne [Am] sochaa [D] nahi,        Tu jo [Am] ud jaye [G] gi
Yeh [Am] zameen tere [D] bin,        Suni [Am] reh jaye [G] gi
Kiske [C] dum pe sajegaa [D] meraa anagna,        [G] O Ri Chiraiya, meri Chiraiya
[C] Angana mein [D] phir aja [G] re,        Tere [Em] pankho mein [G] saare
[D] Sitare [G] jadun,        Teri [Em] chunar [G] dhanak
Sat [D] rangi [G] bunoo,        Tere [Am] kaajal mein [D] main
Kaali [Am] rainaa [G] bharun,        Teri [Am] mehandi mein [D] main
Kachchi [Am] dhup [G] malun,        Tere [C] naino sajaa doon [D] nayaa sapnaa
[G] O Ri Chiraiya, meri Chiraiya,        [C] Angana mein [D] phir aja [G] re
[G] O Ri Chiraiya Nanhi si chidiya,        [C] Angana mein [D] phir aja [G] re
